</figure>
<figure id="A2.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.12203v1/abla_lazy_optim.png" id="A2.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/289;" width="476" height="289" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11. </span>Qualitative ablation of WTA and Latent Init with U-Nets on Drag-Bench.</figcaption>
